From b399d10f48adb1f8fa8b947c31e5357ae7439d79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ekansh Gupta <ekansh.gupta@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:36:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] inc: add SPDX-License-Identifier to uthash.h

uthash.h is bundled and compiled into libadsprpc, libcdsprpc, and
libsdsprpc but was missed by the SPDX tagging in #413. Tag it with its
actual upstream license (BSD-1-Clause) rather than this repo's usual
BSD-3-Clause.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/qualcomm/fastrpc/pull/424]
Signed-off-by: Ekansh Gupta <ekansh.gupta@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 inc/uthash.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/inc/uthash.h b/inc/uthash.h
index 96322074..5539f42d 100644
--- a/inc/uthash.h
+++ b/inc/uthash.h
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-1-Clause */
 /*
 Copyright (c) 2003-2011, Troy D. Hanson     http://uthash.sourceforge.net
 All rights reserved.
